    "impacts.flesh uses impact_soft_medium (soft thud) as an approximation; impacts.generic uses impact_generic_light for concrete and unknown surfaces.",
    "ambient.machinery_hum is Kenney Sci-fi engine_circular_000 used as an approximate indoor hum; ambient.time_rift is force_field_000.",
    "textures are 128x128 PS1-style surface textures; tileable status not verified.",
    "footsteps.gravel/water/sand, weapons.pistol_fire/reload, ambient.harbor_wind/indoor_room_tone: OpenGameArt CC0 (see CREDITS.md). weapons.rifle_fire: CC-BY 3.0, attribution required (see CREDITS.md)."
